            "review_title": "Review at Cookie's House",
            "review_text": "Jonny B\nMaxwell, Barbados1 contribution\n0\nExcellent coffee and cake - might have moved location\nMay 2018 • Couples\nReally nice little coffee shop, music made a nice change from the dated pop you hear in many other places. The cakes are very nice too. \nWe stumbled across it near where we were staying (near 394-416 Đường Võ Văn Kiệt, Cô Giang, Quận 1, Hồ Chí Minh) and couldn’t find one with this address so it might not be at the current address on TripAdvisor unless it is a second one.\nRead more\nWritten May 25, 2018",
